{"ref":"BDB, שַׁבָּתוֹן","hw":"שַׁבָּתוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁבָּתוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.m. sabbath observance, sabbatism</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a> + 10 times P; usually phrase <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּתוֹן</span> <em>sabbath of sabbatic observance;</em>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of weekly sabbath <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:15\" href=\"/Exodus.31.15\">Ex 31:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:2\" href=\"/Exodus.35.2\">35:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.3\">Lv 23:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁבָּתוֹן שַׁבַּת קֹדֶשׁ</span>, prob. transp.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  day of atonement <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.31\">Lv 16:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.32\">23:32</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  sabbatical year <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.4\">Lv 25:4</a>, cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שַׁבָּתוֹן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שַׁבָּתוֹן\">שְׁנַת שַׁבָּתוֹן</a> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.5\">5</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> alone of feast of trumpets <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.24\">Lv 23:24</a>, and of first and eighth days of feast of tabernacles v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.39\">39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.39\">39</a>.","next":"BDB, שַׁבְּתַי","prev":"BDB, שָׁבַת²"}